timestamp=2026-11-04T16:05:11.356Z level=INFO run=e9a56b16 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat > /tmp/dedup.py << 'PY'\nimport math\n\ndef choose_best(rows_for_rid):\n    # rows_for_rid: list of row dicts with same rid\n    # choose: latest event_time; if tie in event_time (same datetime), break ties by preferring version with a real net result, then earlier file order\n    best = None\n    for r in rows_for_rid:\n        if best is None:\n            best = r\n            continue\n        # compare\n        # latest event_time first\n        et_b = best['et']\n        et_r = r['et']\n        # handle None? event_time might be None\n        if et_r != et_b:\n            # want latest - so if et_r is later, replace\n            if et_r is not None and et_b is None:\n                best = r; continue\n            if et_r is None and et_b is not None:\n                continue  # keep best\n            if et_r > et_b:\n                best = r; continue\n            if et_r < et_b:\n                continue\n        # tie in event_time\n        # prefer version with a real net result (not NaN)\n        net_b_real = not math.isnan(best['net'])\n        net_r_real = not math.isnan(r['net'])\n        if net_r_real != net_b_real:\n            if net_r_real and not net_b_real:\n                best = r; continue\n            if net_b_real and not net_r_real:\n                continue\n        # earlier file order\n        if r['file_order'] < best['file_order']:\n            best = r; continue\n        if r['file_order'] > best['file_order']:\n            continue\n    return best\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
