timestamp=2026-11-04T16:06:25.207Z level=INFO run=e9a56b16 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Now compute robust z-score within each (region, month) group\n# month is YYYY-MM from event_time\n# robust z-score using median and MAD (0 if MAD == 0, otherwise 0.6745 * (net - median) / MAD)\nimport math\nimport statistics\n\ndef mad(values):\n    if len(values) == 0:\n        return 0\n    med = statistics.median(values)\n    abs_dev = [abs(v - med) for v in values]\n    mad_val = statistics.median(abs_dev)\n    return mad_val\n\ndef robust_z(x, values):\n    if len(values) == 0:\n        return 0\n    med = statistics.median(values)\n    mad_val = mad(values) if False else None\n    # compute mad properly\n    abs_dev = [abs(v - med) for v in values]\n    mad_val = statistics.median(abs_dev)\n    if mad_val == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    return 0.6745 * (x - med) / mad_val if mad_val != 0 else 0.0\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
